{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for VintageChrono', 'description': "Primary container for VintageChrono implementation: PastBlast is a responsive web app that lets users explore historical events for any date, styled with a vintage newspaper aesthetic. It features a parchment background, elegant serif fonts, and interactive elements like a brass rotary date picker, pocket-watch timeline, and wax seal/typewriter key buttons. Users can view notable events from Wikipedia's 'On This Day' API, see NYT headlines, and enjoy features like 'Random Year', 'My Birth Year', and vintage sound toggles. The UI uses cards styled as newspaper clippings, with loading animations resembling paper flips or quill writing. The design is fully responsive and accessible.", 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Date Picker",\n      "description": "A brass dial or rotary-style date picker for selecting any day, month, and year. Defaults to today\\u2019s date.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Timeline Slider",\n      "description": "A pocket-watch styled slider to quickly browse through years.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Historical Events Feed",\n      "description": "Displays 5\\u201310 notable events from Wikipedia\'s \'On This Day\' API for the selected date, shown as newspaper clipping cards or accordions.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "NYT Headlines",\n      "description": "Shows 2\\u20133 New York Times headlines from the selected month/year, styled as newsprint cutouts with source links and thumbnails.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Random Year Button",\n      "description": "A \'\\ud83c\\udfb2 Random Year\' button that jumps to a surprise date in history.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "My Birth Year Feature",\n      "description": "A \'\\ud83d\\udcdc My Birth Year\' feature that fetches info based on user-inputted birth date.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Vintage Sound Toggle",\n      "description": "Toggle for typewriter clicks or phonograph music as background sound effects.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Loading Animation",\n      "description": "Paper flipping or quill writing animation while loading data.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Responsive Design",\n      "description": "Fully responsive layout for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2f2f2f",\n    "secondary": "#6a4e42",\n    "accent": "#bfa77a"\n  },\n  "theme": "auto",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app uses a parchment-textured background with faded paper borders and subtle creases. The header features the \'PastBlast\' logo in a large, elegant serif font. Below, a rotary date picker and pocket-watch timeline slider allow date selection. Main content displays event cards styled as vintage newspaper clippings, with NYT headlines in a sidebar or below. Buttons resemble wax seals or typewriter keys, and interactive elements have ink-smudge or page-turn hover effects. Sound toggle and loading animation controls are in the top-right. The layout adapts fluidly to all screen sizes, maintaining readability and vintage charm."\n}'}",
